	quest.014B16B31CD88AEF.title: "&e&lGold Crafter&r"
	quest.01569B2B47145474.quest_desc: ["You ever spend 3 months studying &oGalatic Code&r to finally understand &5Enchantment Table&r language just for it to be gibberish? \\n\\nNo? \\n\\nMe either, but &9Enchanting Clues&r are your actual translator for it! \\n\\nEach &9Enchanting Clue&r will tell you 1 &5Enchantment&r before you actually use it."]
	quest.01569B2B47145474.title: "&3Enchanting Clues"
	quest.015BFDF933BED265.quest_desc: ["Holds a violently stupid amount of gas."]
	quest.015BFDF933BED265.quest_subtitle: "More gas holder"
	quest.015BFDF933BED265.title: "&6&lSupreme Chemical Tank&r"
	quest.0173AC3BC88BE37C.quest_desc: ["&ePneumatic Elevators&r! Fast, smooth, pressure-powered travel."]
	quest.0183CC2879BB9EC5.quest_desc: [
		"A natural continuation of the previous step."
		""
		"Craft or obtain the &bEnder Gate Niotic&r."
		"Another piece of the machine chain. On its own it does little; wired into the rest of your factory it removes one more job you were doing by hand."
		"Part of the &7Powah&r progression."
		"&8Next: Ender Gate Spirited."
	]
	quest.0183CC2879BB9EC5.quest_subtitle: "&7Powah"
	quest.0183CC2879BB9EC5.title: "&bEnder Gate Niotic"
	quest.01855F24FF860E27.quest_desc: ["The &6&oLibrary of Alexandria&r is a better &5Enchantment Library&r. \\n\\nIt can hold higher Levels of &5Enchanted Books&r, but it will still need the Level of &5Book&r to get taken out at that Level. \\n\\nIt will also hold more Points. The &5Enchantment Library&r can hold 32768, while the &6&oLibrary of Alexandria&r can hold 1.1 Billion Points of each &5Book&r! \\n\\nTo obtain it, we'll need to &d&lInfuse&r the &5Enchantment Library&r. \\n\\nUse 4 &9Soul-Touched Sculkshelves&f, 4 &9Echoing Sculkshelves&f, 1 &dDraconic Endshelf&f, 5 &6Geode-Encased Bookshelves of Stability&r, and a Skeleton Skull."]
	quest.01855F24FF860E27.quest_subtitle: "Just imagine if Rome never burned..."
	quest.01855F24FF860E27.title: "&6&oLibrary of Alexandria"
	quest.0196E3AC952C15D5.quest_desc: [
		"&7The result of your hard work."
		""
		"&a&1Blutonium Ingots&a can be used in your reactor"
		"&ajust like Yellorium, but they yield significantly"
		"&amore power and last much longer."
	]
	quest.0196E3AC952C15D5.quest_subtitle: "&7Efficient energy."
	quest.0196E3AC952C15D5.title: "&1&lBlutonium Fuel"
	quest.01A8AFDE8C11ADE4.quest_desc: [
		"A step up from what came before."
		""
		"Craft or obtain the &bDielectric Rod&r."
		"A crafting intermediate. Boring on its own, essential in volume - automate production before the recipes that need it pile up."
