		"&8Next: Uraninite, Dry Ice."
	]
	quest.01A8AFDE8C11ADE4.quest_subtitle: "&7Powah"
	quest.01A8AFDE8C11ADE4.title: "&bDielectric Rod"
	quest.01A8E3CE5FF88292.quest_desc: [
		"A &dSpirit Catalyzer&r burns mortal fuel to stoke the Crucible’s hunger, its purpose simple yet dangerous; speed at any cost. Up to eight Catalyzers may serve a single Crucible, each feeding it with furnace-born energy."
		""
		"This acceleration, however, tears at the Impetus, shortening its lifespan and rendering creation unstable. Those who rush the spirit’s rhythm soon learn that haste, too, has a price... often paid in silence."
	]
	quest.01A8E3CE5FF88292.quest_subtitle: "To hasten the work is to tempt the flame."
	quest.01A8E3CE5FF88292.title: "&dSpirit Catalyzer&r"
	quest.01AD6E96BD767CF9.quest_desc: [
		"&6A milestone.&r"
		""
		"Craft or obtain the &6Unobtainium Upgrade Smithing Template&r."
		"An upgrade module. Slotting these in is how you turn a functional machine into a fast one without rebuilding your entire setup."
		"Part of the &7AllTheModium&r progression."
		"&8The end of this branch."
	]
	quest.01AD6E96BD767CF9.quest_subtitle: "&7AllTheModium"
	quest.01AD6E96BD767CF9.title: "&6Unobtainium Upgrade Smithing Template"
