	quest.02713EB7F8CB8AEA.title: "&7&lBulk Item Filter&r"
	quest.02808BBA6229D40D.quest_subtitle: "Alchemical power. Consumes potions, scaling with their brewing complexity."
	quest.02A999506FA3F989.quest_desc: [
		"This is where the chapter stops being introductory."
		""
		"Craft or obtain the &bEnergy Cable Hardened&r."
		"It moves resources between machines. Throughput is the whole point - undersized transfer is the most common reason a factory looks busy but produces nothing."
