		"This is it. The &b&lInfinity Ingot&r."
		""
		"An item that makes you a god. You can now craft tools that mine an entire chunk in one swing, or a sword that &ekills even in creative mode&r."
		""
		"Enjoy your divinity before the admin realizes what you've built."
	]
	quest.02B61CBBBDA7CFAE.quest_subtitle: "Creative mode on survival"
	quest.02B61CBBBDA7CFAE.title: "&b&lInfinite Power&r"
