	quest.04EE321A5037754E.title: "&6&lAllTheModium Gear"
	quest.04F5161B22A038D6.quest_desc: [
		"A mere blade slays the flesh, but a &dCrude Scythe&r, with Soulstone embedded within, rends the spirit as well. The harvest of life and essence are one act. A single swing that calls Spirit from its vessel to the hand of the reaper."
		""
		"Though humble in form, the Scythe’s arc sweeps across many foes, its reach born of ancient design. Through enchantments unknown to common smiths, the Scythe may gain strange new properties. Some call forth more souls, others grant a fleeting lift to the bearer."
		""
		"Use it well, for every spirit claimed remembers its slayer."
	]
	quest.04F5161B22A038D6.quest_subtitle: "To sever the body is mortal work. To sever the soul is art."
	quest.04F5161B22A038D6.title: "&dCrude Scythe&r"
	quest.04FA161D2990DCE4.quest_desc: [
		"This is where the chapter stops being introductory."
		""
		"Craft or obtain the &bEnder Cell Hardened&r."
		"Another piece of the machine chain. On its own it does little; wired into the rest of your factory it removes one more job you were doing by hand."
		"Part of the &7Powah&r progression."
		"&8Next: Ender Cell Blazing."
	]
	quest.04FA161D2990DCE4.quest_subtitle: "&7Powah"
	quest.04FA161D2990DCE4.title: "&bEnder Cell Hardened"
	quest.05004C578BE58BD4.quest_desc: [
