	quest.080568C1B4F8DE9B.quest_desc: ["&5&lApotheosis&r knows how annoying &3Tridents&r can be to get so they made it easier... well kinda easier! \\n\\nYou can now make an &3Inert Trident&r and &d&lInfuse&r it to get a normal &3Trident&r. \\n\\nThe &3Trident&r requires between &a40 Eterna&r, &c20%-50% Quanta&r, and atleast &535% Arcana&r. \\n\\nYou can get this with 5 &7Basic Bookshelves&r and 3 &9Echoing Sculkshelves&r.\\n\\nOr, if you really want a &3Trident&r on &2&lFrontier&r, you can also get this with 2 &bCrystalline Seashelves&r and 4 &bInfused Seashelves&r."]
	quest.080568C1B4F8DE9B.title: "Making a real &3Trident"
