	quest.08F135432B483483.quest_desc: ["&7Basic Bookshelves&r are your starting point, but definitely not your end point. Atleast not &7Basic Bookshelves&r. \\n\\nWith only &7Basic Bookshelves&r you can only get &aEterna&r up and to a max of 30. \\n(I will explain the &5Enchantment Levels&r soon but just know you need them up)\\n\\n(&7Basic Bookshelves&r and vanilla &7Bookshelves&r are interchangeable)"]
