	quest.09497CB2F8A68007.title: "&fStainless Steel Age"
	quest.095124C7453259A4.quest_desc: ["The third and final tier of &5Ender Lead&r is here! This one is unbreakable and can even bind mobs to Spawners. It will require a considerably more tricky &d&lInfusion&r setup. We'll need at least &a75 Eterna&r, &c85% Quanta&r, and between &560-85% Arcana&r.\\n\\nYou can get this with 4 &9Soul-Touched Sculkshelves&r, 4 &9Echoing Sculkshelves&r, 3 &7Stoneshelves&r, and 2 &7Basic Bookshelves&r. Oh, and you also need a Witch in the Ender Lead used for this &d&lInfusion&r."]
	quest.095124C7453259A4.quest_subtitle: "Nothing to do with Occultism I swear"
	quest.095124C7453259A4.title: "&5Occult Ender Lead"
