	quest.09519550DBBAFE20.quest_subtitle: "&7Occultism"
	quest.09519550DBBAFE20.title: "&5Divination Rod"
	quest.0953F0169174E516.title: "First Steps"
	quest.095AE63EDADDDF25.quest_desc: ["You might have noticed that your &aEterna&r refuses to go above &a30&r, even if you used &4Hellshelves&r or &bSeashelves&r. This is because &lWorld Tiers&r determine your &aMax Eterna&r now.\\n\\nOn &9&lHaven&r (the first &lWorld Tier&r), it's &a30&r. On &2&lFrontier&r, it's &a45&r.\\n\\nCheck out the Apotheosis Gear chapter or the linked quests in the &lWorld Tiers&r section of this chapter to learn more about &lWorld Tiers&r."]
	quest.095AE63EDADDDF25.quest_subtitle: "Why is my Eterna capped to 30?"
	quest.095AE63EDADDDF25.title: "The &2&lFrontier&r Calls"
