	quest.0D1880B7CCFDC003.quest_desc: ["The &6&oGem Case of House Fabergé&r is a better &5Gem Case&r. \\n\\nIt can hold higher amounts of &aGems&r.\\n\\nThe &5Gem Case&r can hold 32768, while the &6&oGem Case of House Fabergé&r can hold 2.1 Billion of each unique &aGem&r! \\n\\nTo obtain it, we'll need to &d&lInfuse&r the &5Gem Case&r. \\n\\nUse 4 &9Soul-Touched Sculkshelves&f, 4 &9Echoing Sculkshelves&f, 2 &dDraconic Endshelves&f, 7 &7Stoneshelves&r, and 1 &7Basic Bookshelf&r."]
