	quest.1000000000000039.quest_subtitle: "&7Sixty-four generators, one block"
	quest.1000000000000039.title: "&5Halitosis Generator (64x)"
	quest.1000000000000040.quest_desc: [
		"&6A major milestone.&r"
		"The &6Netherite Generator&r is the strongest solid-fuel machine in the mod - a compact, ancient-debris-forged block that will comfortably satisfy the demands of a full factory."
		"Nothing beyond this point runs on ordinary coal. To go further you must move to &cNether Stars&r, which means killing Withers on an industrial scale."
		"This is the right moment to build a Wither farm, or to lean on Mystical Agriculture's Nether Star crop if your pack allows it."
		"&8Next: the Nether Star Generator - the endgame of this chapter."
	]
	quest.1000000000000040.quest_subtitle: "&6The peak of conventional combustion"
	quest.1000000000000040.title: "&6Netherite Generator"
	quest.1000000000000041.quest_desc: [
		"&6Netherite Generator (8x)&r"
		""
		"The &a8x variant&r does exactly what the name suggests: eight times the generation rate and eight times the internal buffer, in the footprint of a single block."
