	quest.1000000000000041.title: "&6Netherite Generator (8x)"
	quest.1000000000000042.quest_desc: [
		"&6Netherite Generator (64x)&r"
		""
		"The &a64x variant&r is the compressed form of this generator line - sixty-four units of generation and buffer capacity condensed into one block."
		"Server performance improves noticeably when you replace large generator banks with these, since the game only has to tick a single block entity."
