	quest.1000000000000045.title: "&6Nether Star Generator (64x)"
	quest.1005089B79B497DB.quest_desc: ["The worst part about &eCharms&r is that they break! Why would these OP Potion Effects have to have Durability! \\n\\nWell don't you worry, &5&lApotheosis&r has a cure for that... with &d&lInfusions&r! \\n\\nYou'll need &a100 Eterna&r, between &c8.5% &fand &c13.5% Quanta&r, and between &532.5% &fand &537.5% Arcana&r. \\n\\nYou can use 10 &4Glowing Hellshelves&r, 4 &6Geode-Encased Bookshelves of Stability&r, 2 &dDraconic Endshelves&r, and a Skeleton Skull! \\n\\nYes, some Skulls and other Items besides &7Bookshelves&r give stats!"]
	quest.1005089B79B497DB.title: "Unbreakable &eCharms"
	quest.10066D0C26A531C7.quest_desc: ["&7Stores more gas than Jupiter. Physics is dead."]
	quest.10066D0C26A531C7.quest_subtitle: "&dGas giant"
	quest.10066D0C26A531C7.title: "&dUltimate Max Chemical Tank"
