	quest.1088A5CEB8F2A161.title: "&aBasic PRC Factory"
	quest.1088D0505CFBC798.quest_desc: ["The &5Gem Case&r is the single greatest &aApotheosis Gem&r storage, ever! \\n\\nTo Craft it you'll need 1 &3Ender Chest&r, 1 &5Gem Cutting Table&r, 4 Basalt, and 3 Glass blocks. \\n\\nTo use it, you can either Shift Left Click &aGems&r or bring them into the &9Blue Slot&r. This will add the &aGems&r to the &5Case&r.\\n\\nThe &5Case&r can only hold up to 32768 of each unique &aGem&r and Purity (for example, the &5Case&r can hold 32k &zPerfect Gems of the Warlord&r, and 32k &aChipped Gems of the Warlord&r), and they can be extracted by Left Clicking the stored &aGem&r type, then Left Clicking one of the shown Purities.\\n\\nYou can also use the &5Gem Case&r as a Gem Cutting Table, using Rarity Materials and &9Gem Dust&r in the slots to the left. Left Click a stored &aGem&r type, then Left Click one of the hammers to upgrade 2 of those &aGems&r to the next Purity."]
	quest.1088D0505CFBC798.title: "&5Gem Case"
	quest.109E0C71A4F0749C.quest_desc: [
		"Lore: Sheer mechanical force. The Crusher pulverizes items into dusts and grinds down organics."
		""
		"Technical Information: Operates on standard FE. Can process cobblestone to gravel, gravel to sand, and plants to Bio Fuel."
		""
		"Usage: Used in the Bio Fuel production chain and for obtaining trace materials from raw blocks."
		""
		"Goal: Craft a Crusher."
		""
		"Tips: Throwing spare saplings and seeds into the Crusher is a great way to start accumulating Bio Fuel early."
		""
		"Trivia: One of the original trio of Mekanism machines, alongside the Smelter and Enrichment Chamber."
	]
	quest.109E0C71A4F0749C.quest_subtitle: "&7Crushing Power"
	quest.109E0C71A4F0749C.title: "Crusher"
	quest.10A10A10A10A10A1.quest_desc: [
		"Your collector finally finished a cycle. You have a pile of neutrons."
		""
		"Only &ethousands&r more to go before you can actually build something. Don't stare at the machine, it knows when you're watching and works slower."
