	quest.17B02ECA300D7219.quest_desc: [
		"At the heart of Malum lies the &dSpirit Altar&r, an ancient construct through which mortal hands may command the invisible tides of essence. Here, spirits, focus materials, and infusion reagents converge in a ritual of creation."
		""
		"Place your chosen item upon the altar as a focal anchor, and arrange the supporting components upon pedestals within four paces. When the alignment is true, the spirits will awaken; a slow, deliberate dance of matter and will."
		""
		"Should you wish to hasten the process, erect &6Runewood Obelisks&r nearby. Their quiet resonance steadies the current, drawing forth completion from the chaos of becoming."
	]
	quest.17B02ECA300D7219.quest_subtitle: "Where will bends the ether, the world remembers the shape of thought."
	quest.17B02ECA300D7219.title: "&dSpirit Altar&r"
