	quest.1BA6335C6EFA9BC9.quest_desc: ["&9Echo Shards&r can be pretty annoying to farm, plus we'll need a lot of them! So why not have an easier way of Farming them. \\n\\nWith &d&lInfusion&r we can make 1 &9Echo Shard&r into 4! \\n\\nWe'll need &a70 Eterna&r, &c50% Quanta&r, and &550% Arcana&r. \\n\\nTo get that, we can use either of the following:\\n\\n14 &9Deepshelves&r, that aren't &9Dormant&r!\\n12 &4Glowing Hellshelves&r and 2 &9Deepshelves&r!\\n12 &bCrystalline Seashelves&r and 2 &9Deepshelves&r!"]
	quest.1BA6335C6EFA9BC9.title: "Infinite &9Echo Shards&r?"
