	quest.1D3D9B1EFF24272D.quest_desc: [
		"Lore: Harnesses raw electricity to break molecular bonds, splitting fluids into their constituent gases."
		""
		"Technical Information: The most power-hungry basic machine. Produces two distinct gas outputs."
		""
		"Usage: Primarily used to split Water into Hydrogen and Oxygen, or Brine into Sodium and Chlorine."
		""
		"Goal: Craft an Electrolytic Separator."
		""
		"Tips: Use the 'Dumping' toggles in the UI if you only need one of the two gases; otherwise, the machine will jam."
		""
		"Trivia: Real-world electrolysis requires an electrolyte, but Mekanism manages it with sheer voltage."
	]
