	quest.20D339B883A4BB59.quest_desc: [
		"Lore: A solid-state energy reservoir. It stabilizes and stores large amounts of raw power."
		""
		"Technical Information: Stores 4M FE. Retains its energy when broken with a pickaxe."
		""
		"Usage: Acts as a battery buffer for your base. Can be used to manually transport energy."
		""
		"Goal: Craft a Basic Energy Cube."
		""
		"Tips: Use the Configurator or the UI to set specific sides to Input (Red) and Output (Green)."
		""
		"Trivia: The Energy Cube is visually iconic, with a floating inner core that spins faster as it charges."
	]
