	quest.2119DDD6D109A867.quest_desc: ["Now that you have maximized your max &aEterna&r at &a100&r, you can start &d&lInfusing&r &6Godforged Pearls&r!\\n\\n&6Godforged Pearls&r can be obtained by salvaging &6Mythic&r &eItems&r in a &c&lSalvaging Table&r.\\n\\nYou'll need &a100 Eterna&r, &c9.65-11.00% Quanta&r, and &558.75-60.0% Arcana&r.\\n\\nYou can get this with 1 &dDraconic Endshelf&r, 6 &6Geode-Encased Bookshelves of Stability&r, 1 &9Echoing Sculkshelf&r, 5 &9Soul-Touched Sculkshelves&r, 1 &7Stoneshelf&r, and 1 Candle."]
