	quest.230C367BD47BECC8.quest_desc: ["Once we get those 15 &4Hellshelves&r around our &5Enchantment Table&r, we'll have &a45 Eterna&r and &c30% Quanta&r in our &5Table&r. \\n\\nThis is the perfect amount to &d&lInfuse&r our &4Hellshelves&r! \\n\\n&4Infused Hellshelves&r give &a5 Eterna&r with a max of &a60 Eterna&r, along with &c5% Quanta&r. \\n\\nThese can be Crafted with other Items to make different &7Bookshelves&r, for the ones we want we'll need 12 &4Infused Hellshelves&r! \\n\\nOf course, with me being soooo generous, you'll only need to collect 8!"]
