		"Lore: Coalesces gaseous slop back into perfect, solid matter."
		""
		"Technical Information: The final step in 4x and 5x ore processing, turning clean ore slurries into crystals."
		""
		"Usage: Input Clean Slurry gas, receive Solid Ore Crystals, which are then processed into ingots."
		""
		"Goal: Craft a Chemical Crystallizer."
		""
		"Tips: This machine is notably slow. You will likely need speed upgrades or multiple machines to keep up with the preceding dissolution steps."
		""
		"Trivia: The crystals it produces look like perfectly cut gemstones of their respective metals."
	]
