	quest.297E88C50A524CFE.title: "Advanced Mechanics"
	quest.29A01B98BA1DEB86.quest_desc: ["&4&lThe Nether&r can be pretty scary, if you'd rather voyage the &bSea&r, use &bSeashelves&r! \\n\\n&bSeashelves&r are your introduction to &5Arcana&r, they give &53% Arcana&r and &a3 Eterna&r. \\n\\nBetter than normal &7Shelves&r right? \\n\\nYou're going to need 16 for &d&lInfusing&r... well 15 for &d&lInfusing&r, 1 to be &d&lInfused&r! \\n\\nLike the &4Hellshelves&r, I'll give you extra, just collect 11 now!"]
	quest.29A01B98BA1DEB86.title: "&bSeashelves"
	quest.29B0C1D2E3F40516.quest_desc: ["Did you know? Every single generator in this mod can be crafted into 8x and 64x variants to produce absolutely massive amounts of energy!"]
