	quest.2C9C5A35B2C4F57A.quest_desc: ["To upgrade &9Deepshelves&r even farther, surprisingly we don't need &d&lInfusion&r! Instead we need more Crafting! \\n\\nFirst, is 5 &3Sculk Blocks&r and a &3Sculk Catalyst&r. Both can be found within the &9Deep Dark&r and will need &5Silk Touch&r to collect. \\n\\nLast is the &9Warden Tendril&r... this is a Drop from the &9&lWarden&r... Yes, you'll need to kill the &9&lWarden&r. \\n\\nOnce you have all that you can Craft one of the best &7Bookshelves&r! One that gives &a10 Eterna&r, &c15% Quanta&r, and &510% Arcana&r. \\n\\nAnd most importantly, gives us a max &aEterna&r of &a80&r! Almost to 100!"]
	quest.2C9C5A35B2C4F57A.title: "&9Soul-Touched Sculkshelf"
	quest.2C9FE1F35948F86F.quest_desc: ["&cMekanism&r introduces &fmicroplastics&r to your Minecraft world. How &awonderful&r."]
