	quest.37AB31F4CCB00A28.quest_desc: [
		"Lore: Combines two distinct gases into a singular, highly reactive chemical compound."
		""
		"Technical Information: Only accepts gases (requires Pressurized Tubes). Does not accept liquids."
		""
		"Usage: Used to mix Sulfur Dioxide and Oxygen to create Sulfur Trioxide, a key step in acid production."
		""
		"Goal: Craft a Chemical Infuser."
		""
		"Tips: Gas networks can be hard to visualize. Place the infuser close to your Separators/Oxidizers to avoid tube spaghetti."
		""
		"Trivia: Essential for climbing the ore multiplication ladder beyond 2x."
	]
