	quest.37F379D4A4C0E2EA.quest_desc: [
		"Through the infusion of Spirit into fine cloth, one may craft &dSpirit Fabric&r a material of ethereal resilience. It bends with the light and hums faintly when held, as though remembering the souls that wove it."
		""
		"Such silk forms the base for much of Malum’s later artifice — wearable, enchantable, and profoundly attuned to the wielder’s essence. Handle it reverently; it is not just fabric, but memory, spun thin."
	]
	quest.37F379D4A4C0E2EA.quest_subtitle: "Threads spun from whispers bind more tightly than steel."
