	quest.3E836869BAC5C239.quest_desc: ["Ever wanted to pick up mobs? We...have Soul Gems and Creature Catchers for that.\\n\\nLet's just ignore those for now and focus on the option &5&lApotheosis&r offers. The &5Flimsy Ender Lead&r is the cheapest variant of &5Ender Lead&r, but also the weakest, and most fragile. It can only hold animals, and breaks after 8 uses."]
