	quest.43FFD1307D00B642.quest_desc: ["The last &lWorld Tier&r, &lWorld Tier: &4Pinnacle&r. To get it, you'll need to Kill the &d&lEnder Dragon&r atleast once, and equip all &5Epic&r or &6Mythic&r &eArmor &fand &eTool/Weapon&r. \\n\\nNow &5Epic&r and &6Mythic&r are most common for &aGems &fand &eTools&r, plus we are more likely to get &zPerfect&r gems! This comes at the loss of &8Common&r and &aUncommon&r but hey, who'll miss them! \\n\\nOn the same pattern of upgrades you'll get 125% Experience Gained and 100% Luck increase, and your &aMax Eterna&r reaches its highest point, &a100&r. \\n\\n&4Monsters&r will receive their final upgrade, getting: 16 Armor Points, 20 Armor Toughness, 25 Armor Pierce, and 20 Protection Pierce."]
	quest.43FFD1307D00B642.title: "&lWorld Tier: &4Pinnacle"
