	quest.4490C28E1E47C571.quest_desc: ["&5Budding Amethyst&r can be useful for Crafting Recipes and even just Growing &5Amethyst&r! \\n\\nWith a &5Amethyst Block&r, &a60 Eterna&r, between &c30% &fand &c50% Quanta&r, and &550% Arcana&r we can &d&lInfuse&r one. \\n\\nTo get all those stats we can use 10 &9Deepshelves&r (not &9Dormant&r ones), 2 &2Melonshelves&r, and 7 &7Basic Bookshelves&r.\\n\\nOr, if you chose &bSeashelves&r, you can use 11 &bCrystalline Seashelves&r and 1 &bInfused Seashelf&r."]
