	quest.48846E2C097599C8.quest_desc: [
		"&6That is everything you need to start.&r"
		"From here the book opens into nine groups: exploration, resources, storage, tech, magic, bosses and the endgame tiers beyond them."
		"There is no single correct route. Most players start with &bCreate&r or &aMystical Agriculture&r, drift into &bMekanism&r for processing, and pick up magic when they want better gear."
		"Pick a chapter that looks interesting and go."
		"&8Good luck."
	]
