	]
	quest.4ADF292A6FABD6EC.quest_subtitle: "Fancy table"
	quest.4ADF292A6FABD6EC.title: "&9&lEngineer's Workbench&r"
	quest.4AF410C93641F068.quest_desc: ["With 8 &7Books&r and an Anvil we can make the &8Tome of Scrapping&r. Well actually 8 of them, but you get the picture! \\n\\nBy combining an Item with the &8Tome&r in an Anvil, we can take half the &5Enchantments&r off the Item. \\n\\nThis will end up breaking and voiding the Item after it is done. I don't recommend using it, rather you should upgrade it!"]
	quest.4AF410C93641F068.quest_subtitle: "Half Enchantments, breaks Items"
	quest.4AF410C93641F068.title: "&8Tome of Scrapping"
	quest.4AF80C658F5FD63C.quest_desc: [
		"&7You need power to make power."
		""
		"&aCraft a &cFurnator&a (burns solid fuel like coal)"
		"&aor a &cMagmator&a (burns liquid fuel like lava)."
		"&aThese are your reliable early-game power sources."
		""
		"&7Both upgrade through all tiers — a Nitro Furnator"
		"&7burning coal blocks outputs staggering FE/t."
	]
	quest.4AF80C658F5FD63C.quest_subtitle: "&7Burning for power."
	quest.4AF80C658F5FD63C.title: "&c&lEarly Generation"
	quest.4B040765D4057A59.quest_desc: [
		"&6A capstone. Everything before this was preparation.&r"
		""
		"Craft or obtain the &6End Prediction&r."
		"Another step along this mod's arcane progression. The power curve here is steep, and skipping stages tends to cost more time than it saves."
		"Part of the &7Hostile Neural Networks&r progression."
		"&8The end of this branch."
	]
	quest.4B040765D4057A59.quest_subtitle: "&7Hostile Neural Networks"
	quest.4B040765D4057A59.title: "&6End Prediction"
	quest.4B1B64E2DE77172D.quest_desc: ["mekasuit without full set or power acts like a normal set of armor, however when you charge it (and upgrade it) you gain magic resistance, water breathing, flight, speed, jump boost and other various commodities with them all bein able to be turned off and on as you please. even the base armor is bolstering infinite protection, assuming you charge it"]
	quest.4B1B64E2DE77172D.quest_subtitle: "The ultimate protection"
	quest.4B1B64E2DE77172D.title: "&6Groundwork Laid"
	quest.4B1D639262928F5F.quest_desc: ["&7The &cME Drive&7 houses your storage cells. This is where your physical items are converted into digital data."]
	quest.4B1D639262928F5F.quest_subtitle: "&cDigital Storage"
	quest.4B29E4AAD20C2682.quest_desc: ["&7The highest standard tier of capacitor."]
	quest.4B29E4AAD20C2682.title: "&6Octadic Capacitor"
	quest.4B2A7CAAA567ACD4.quest_desc: ["Roots enemies in place so you can finally hit your &cterrible shots&r."]
	quest.4B2A7CAAA567ACD4.quest_subtitle: "Stay. Put."
	quest.4B2A7CAAA567ACD4.title: "&2&lGlyph of Snare&r"
	quest.4B2E853B49079D7E.quest_desc: ["&eHardened Magmator&r. Now we're guzzling magma. Say RIP to your &btemporary fluid tanks&r."]
	quest.4B2E853B49079D7E.title: "&e&lHardened Magmator&r"
	quest.4B315A7F0BF78D68.quest_desc: [
		"Places blocks in the world."
		""
		"Combine this with a Breaker Module to build overly complicated, laggy vanilla-style farms instead of just using a normal machine."
	]
	quest.4B315A7F0BF78D68.quest_subtitle: "Auto-builder"
	quest.4B315A7F0BF78D68.title: "&a&lPlacer Module&r"
	quest.4B42DE0B8ACC4A56.quest_desc: [
		"You have the prerequisites. Now put them to use."
		""
		"Craft or obtain the &6Vibranium Ingot&r."
		"A crafting intermediate. Boring on its own, essential in volume - automate production before the recipes that need it pile up."
		"Part of the &7AllTheModium&r progression."
		"&8Next: Allthemodium Block, Vibranium Upgrade Smithing Template, Vibranium Boots."
	]
	quest.4B42DE0B8ACC4A56.quest_subtitle: "&7AllTheModium"
	quest.4B42DE0B8ACC4A56.title: "&6Vibranium Ingot"
	quest.4B623BE97AB72169.quest_desc: [
		"Steady progress. This one is not glamorous, but the chapter does not work without it."
		""
		"Craft or obtain the &bBedrock&r."
		"A vanilla staple, used here as the foundation for something considerably less vanilla."
		"Part of the &7Minecraft&r progression."
		"&8Next: Infinity Catalyst."
	]
	quest.4B623BE97AB72169.quest_subtitle: "&7Minecraft"
	quest.4B623BE97AB72169.title: "&bBedrock"
	quest.4B694E91ADABACC3.quest_desc: [
		"A captured Blaze used as a glorified stove."
		""
		"Feed it coal to make things hot, feed it a Blaze Cake to make things &cstupidly hot&r."
	]
	quest.4B694E91ADABACC3.quest_subtitle: "Spicy prisoner"
	quest.4B694E91ADABACC3.title: "&c&lBlaze Burner&r"
	quest.4B694F8EB223DB7C.quest_desc: [
		"Know this, Seeker: the essence of Malum is not mere sorcery, but the shaping of that which lies between thought and form. &dSoulstone&r (both raw and refined) is the keystone of this forgotten craft. From it are born two sacred instruments: the &6Spirit Altar&r, and the &6Crude Scythe&r."
		""
		"The ancients wrote that Soulstone hums faintly near places where reality thins, its resonance whispering in the void. Seek such stones, or form them through alchemical rites, for they will awaken the latent breath of your own soul."
		""
		"Rumors speak of a structure beyond the veil, a weeping thing that pulls upon certain relics and whispers trades in forgotten tongues. Some say the first Soulstone was bargained for, not made."
	]
	quest.4B694F8EB223DB7C.quest_subtitle: "The soul is not found... it is forged in silence."
	quest.4B694F8EB223DB7C.title: "&dSoulstone&r"
	quest.4B6CC1320A18604F.quest_desc: [
		"&7Plant on farmland with matching infused soil to farm this resource hands-free.&r"
		""
		"&8Inferium to Insanium: the tier ladder that turns dirt into Allthemodium.&r"
	]
	quest.4B6CC1320A18604F.quest_subtitle: "Plant. Harvest. Repeat."
	quest.4B6CC1320A18604F.title: "Iron Seeds"
	quest.4B9455D96952AF6C.quest_desc: [
		"&7The &6Large Rotary Condensentrator&7 is a massive upgrade over the standard version."
		""
		"&7It processes gases into liquids (and vice versa) at &eunprecedented speeds&7. Perfect for bulk processing &bLithium&7 or &6Steam&7."
	]
	quest.4B9455D96952AF6C.quest_subtitle: "Industrial Condensing"
	quest.4B9455D96952AF6C.title: "&6Large Rotary Condensentrator"
	quest.4BA74A76D42C44C6.quest_desc: [
		"&7The second tier of legendary metals."
		""
		"&a&aVibranium&a is typically found high up in the"
		"&aNether ceiling or deep within Warped Forests."
		"&aIt absorbs kinetic energy perfectly."
	]
	quest.4BA74A76D42C44C6.quest_subtitle: "&7Forged in the fiery depths."
	quest.4BA74A76D42C44C6.title: "&a&lVibranium"
	quest.4BA8FD5FDC00BE40.quest_desc: ["The base item for making the router less slow and annoying."]
	quest.4BA8FD5FDC00BE40.quest_subtitle: "More paperwork"
	quest.4BA8FD5FDC00BE40.title: "&7&lBlank Upgrade&r"
	quest.4BD22FBE4A6A9BD7.quest_desc: [
		"Lore: Turns crushed organic matter into a steady stream of power."
		""
		"Technical Information: Burns Bio Fuel to generate FE. Excellent early-game passive power."
		""
		"Usage: Supply with Bio Fuel produced by running crops through a Crusher."
		""
		"Goal: Craft a Bio-Generator."
		""
		"Tips: Pumpkins and Melons make fantastic automated Bio Fuel farms."
		""
		"Trivia: A very clean, green alternative to the Heat Generator."
	]
	quest.4BD22FBE4A6A9BD7.quest_subtitle: "&2Biological Power"
	quest.4BD22FBE4A6A9BD7.title: "Bio-Generator"
	quest.4C0574C553267E6E.quest_desc: ["Do not bathe in it, do not drink it. Excellent for advanced batteries and dissolving all of your recent problems."]
	quest.4C0574C553267E6E.quest_subtitle: "The forbidden soup."
	quest.4C0574C553267E6E.title: "&e&lSulfuric Acid&r"
	quest.4C24A225F1236E04.quest_desc: [
		"&7Plant on farmland with matching infused soil to farm this resource hands-free.&r"
		""
		"&8Inferium to Insanium: the tier ladder that turns dirt into Allthemodium.&r"
	]
	quest.4C24A225F1236E04.quest_subtitle: "Plant. Harvest. Repeat."
	quest.4C24A225F1236E04.title: "Glowstone Seeds"
	quest.4C37356449520E06.quest_desc: ["&7turns seeds, crops and plant into &abiofuel&7, which is useful for things such as blaze burners and ifinity tools (to prevent energy usage)"]
	quest.4C37356449520E06.quest_subtitle: "yup, only useful for infinity tools tho."
	quest.4C37356449520E06.title: "&2What is this? bio gas?"
	quest.4C3B000000000010.quest_desc: [
		"&7The journey to ultimate smelting speed begins here."
		""
		"&aThe &cCopper Furnace&a is slightly faster than"
		"&aa regular furnace and serves as a great entry"
		"&apoint before you commit your precious iron."
	]
	quest.4C3B000000000010.quest_subtitle: "&7A slight step up from cobblestone."
	quest.4C3B000000000010.title: "&c&lHumble Beginnings"
	quest.4C3B000000000020.quest_desc: [
		"&7The standard. The classic."
		""
		"&aThe &fIron Furnace&a provides a noticeable"
		"&aspeed increase over stone. It is the foundation"
		"&afor all higher-tier processing."
	]
	quest.4C3B000000000020.quest_subtitle: "&7The namesake of the mod."
	quest.4C3B000000000020.title: "&f&lThe Classic Iron"
	quest.4C3B000000000030.quest_desc: [
		"&7If you have silver to spare, this furnace"
		"&7offers an alternative to the standard progression."
		""
		"&aIt sits comfortably between Iron and Gold"
		"&ain terms of efficiency."
	]
	quest.4C3B000000000030.quest_subtitle: "&7An alternative path."
	quest.4C3B000000000030.title: "&7&lSilver Smelting"
	quest.4C3B000000000040.quest_desc: [
		"&7Gold is a fantastic conductor of heat."
		""
		"&aThe &eGold Furnace&a smelts items very quickly,"
		"&abut be warned: its fuel efficiency isn't"
		"&athe best."
	]
	quest.4C3B000000000040.quest_subtitle: "&7Faster, but burns fuel quicker."
	quest.4C3B000000000040.title: "&e&lGolden Heat"
	quest.4C3B000000000050.quest_desc: [
		"&7Now we are getting to the good stuff."
		""
		"&aThe &bDiamond Furnace&a is incredibly fast"
		"&aand highly fuel-efficient. A must-have for"
		"&aany mid-game base."
	]
	quest.4C3B000000000050.quest_subtitle: "&7The standard for serious processing."
	quest.4C3B000000000050.title: "&b&lDiamond Intensity"
	quest.4C3B000000000060.quest_desc: [
		"&7Villagers would weep to see this."
		""
		"&aThe &aEmerald Furnace&a blazes through stacks"
		"&aof items in seconds."
	]
	quest.4C3B000000000060.quest_subtitle: "&7Trading wealth for speed."
	quest.4C3B000000000060.title: "&a&lEmerald Efficiency"
	quest.4C3B000000000070.quest_desc: [
		"&7A beautiful variation of the Diamond tier."
		""
		"&aThe &bCrystal Furnace&a allows you to see"
		"&athe item currently being smelted right"
		"&athrough its transparent casing."
	]
	quest.4C3B000000000070.quest_subtitle: "&7Watch your items melt."
	quest.4C3B000000000070.title: "&b&lCrystal Clear"
	quest.4C3B000000000080.quest_desc: [
		"&7Dense, dark, and devastatingly fast."
		""
		"&aThe &5Obsidian Furnace&a is a top-tier machine"
		"&athat requires serious materials to craft."
	]
	quest.4C3B000000000080.quest_subtitle: "&7Retains heat perfectly."
	quest.4C3B000000000080.title: "&5&lObsidian Core"
	quest.4C3B000000000090.quest_desc: [
		"&7Forged in the depths of the Nether."
		""
		"&aThe &8Netherite Furnace&a represents the pinnacle"
		"&aof standard furnace technology. Its speed"
		"&aand efficiency are practically unmatched."
	]
	quest.4C3B000000000090.quest_subtitle: "&8&lThe ultimate mundane furnace."
	quest.4C3B000000000090.title: "&8&lNetherite Furnace"
	quest.4C3B0000000000B0.quest_desc: [
		"&7Why process one item when you can process many?"
		""
		"&aThe &9Factory Augment&a adds additional input"
		"&aand output slots to your furnace, allowing"
		"&aparallel smelting."
	]
	quest.4C3B0000000000B0.quest_subtitle: "&7Smelt multiple items at once."
	quest.4C3B0000000000B0.title: "&9&lFactory Augment"
	quest.4C3B0000000000C0.quest_desc: [
		"&7Need power early on?"
		""
		"&aThe &eGenerator Augment&a turns any Iron Furnace"
		"&ainto a coal generator, converting solid fuel"
		"&ainto Forge Energy (FE/RF) instead of smelting."
	]
	quest.4C3B0000000000C0.quest_subtitle: "&7Turn heat into energy."
	quest.4C3B0000000000C0.title: "&e&lGenerator Augment"
	quest.4C3B0000000000D0.quest_desc: [
		"&7Standard smelting is fine, but sometimes you"
		"&7need specialized tools."
		""
		"&aInstall a &cBlasting Augment&a to process ores faster,"
		"&aor a &6Smoking Augment&a for rapid food preparation."
	]
	quest.4C3B0000000000D0.quest_subtitle: "&7Smoking and Blasting."
	quest.4C3B0000000000D0.title: "&c&lSpecialized Heating"
	quest.4C3B0000000000E0.quest_desc: [
		"&7The absolute pinnacle of furnace technology."
		""
		"&aThe &dRainbow Furnace&a operates at speeds that"
		"&adefy logic. It will empty a hopper instantly."
		""
		"&7Requires a Rainbow Core and Plating to craft."
	]
	quest.4C3B0000000000E0.quest_subtitle: "&d&lGod-tier smelting speed."
	quest.4C3B0000000000E0.title: "&d&lR&ca&ei&an&bb&9o&5w &f&lFurnace"
	quest.4C48C8155C145A0D.quest_desc: ["So clean it wipes your memory of how many resources you wasted building this."]
	quest.4C48C8155C145A0D.quest_subtitle: "Memory wipe"
	quest.4C48C8155C145A0D.title: "&d&lInfinite Purifying Factory&r"
	quest.4C4F0FBE25643834.quest_desc: ["Lightweight, shiny, and highly conductive. Perfect for power lines and making sure your ambitious new aircraft don't immediately plummet out of the sky."]
	quest.4C4F0FBE25643834.quest_subtitle: "Lighter than your conscience."
	quest.4C4F0FBE25643834.title: "&f&lAluminum Ingot&r"
	quest.4C57C5532337C7DF.quest_desc: ["&75 slots. Gas to shiny rock in record time."]
	quest.4C57C5532337C7DF.quest_subtitle: "&cSolidification"
	quest.4C57C5532337C7DF.title: "&cAdvanced Crystallizing Factory"
	quest.4C5FB10C0B07AE28.quest_desc: ["Turns items into chemicals"]
	quest.4C5FB10C0B07AE28.quest_subtitle: "group hazing event"
	quest.4C5FB10C0B07AE28.title: "&bChemical Oxidizer"
	quest.4C606B5AFDDA0B7B.quest_desc: [
		"&6The high point of this chapter.&r"
		""
		"Craft or obtain the &6Chaotic Shovel&r."
		"A tool or weapon at this tier. Better reach, better speed, and usually a special ability worth learning."
		"Part of the &7Draconic Evolution&r progression."
		"&8The end of this branch."
	]
	quest.4C606B5AFDDA0B7B.quest_subtitle: "&7Draconic Evolution"
	quest.4C606B5AFDDA0B7B.title: "&6Chaotic Shovel"
	quest.4C65AA4BED1AAC80.quest_desc: ["Spreads toxic dust everywhere. Your friends will &clove&r it when you cast this in the base."]
	quest.4C65AA4BED1AAC80.quest_subtitle: "Allergies"
	quest.4C65AA4BED1AAC80.title: "&2&lGlyph of Poison Spores&r"
	quest.4C72F9C15F17D7A0.quest_desc: [
		"A natural continuation of the previous step."
		""
		"Craft or obtain the &eCloud in a Bottle&r."
		"A reward for going where the map gets dangerous. You will not craft your way to this one."
		"Part of the &7Artifacts&r progression."
		"&8Next: Checkpoint."
	]
	quest.4C72F9C15F17D7A0.quest_subtitle: "&7Artifacts"
	quest.4C72F9C15F17D7A0.title: "&eCloud in a Bottle"
	quest.4C75EA4C74D74DC2.quest_desc: [
		"Infinite power transfer."
		""
		"Because the word 'enough' simply does not exist in your vocabulary."
	]
	quest.4C75EA4C74D74DC2.quest_subtitle: "UNLIMITED POWER"
	quest.4C75EA4C74D74DC2.title: "&d&lInfinite Universal Cable&r"
	quest.4C871CC076835460.quest_desc: [
		"Progress here compounds - each tier makes the next one cheaper."
		""
		"Craft or obtain the &bBlock Placer&r."
		"Another piece of the machine chain. On its own it does little; wired into the rest of your factory it removes one more job you were doing by hand."
		"Part of the &7Industrial Foregoing&r progression."
		"&8The end of this branch."
	]
	quest.4C871CC076835460.quest_subtitle: "&7Industrial Foregoing"
	quest.4C871CC076835460.title: "&bBlock Placer"
	quest.4C9D4A8395E29A0F.quest_desc: [
		"The next link in the chain."
		""
		"Craft or obtain the &dDraconic Staff&r."
		"A tool or weapon at this tier. Better reach, better speed, and usually a special ability worth learning."
		"Part of the &7Draconic Evolution&r progression."
		"&8Nothing further depends on this - build it when you want it, not because you have to."
	]
	quest.4C9D4A8395E29A0F.quest_subtitle: "&7Draconic Evolution"
	quest.4C9D4A8395E29A0F.title: "&dDraconic Staff"
	quest.4CA6D41AF965C048.quest_desc: [
		"Worth doing properly the first time - reworking this later is tedious."
		""
		"Craft or obtain the &bBattery Basic&r."
		"It buffers energy so that machines drawing in bursts do not stall the rest of your network."
		"Part of the &7Powah&r progression."
		"&8Next: Battery Hardened."
	]
	quest.4CA6D41AF965C048.quest_subtitle: "&7Powah"
	quest.4CA6D41AF965C048.title: "&bBattery Basic"
	quest.4CA91251D32C3A20.quest_desc: [
		"&7A rock-solid, advanced material."
		""
		"&7Required for top-tier tools, the heaviest armors, and endgame machine construction."
	]
	quest.4CA91251D32C3A20.title: "&5Duratium"
	quest.4CB3E1F490201460.quest_desc: [
		"Lore: Bridges the gap between states of matter, condensing gases into liquids and decondensing liquids into gases."
		""
		"Technical Information: Has a toggle button in the UI to switch between Decondensentrating (Liquid -> Gas) and Condensentrating (Gas -> Liquid)."
		""
		"Usage: Often used to turn Water Vapor back into Water, or Liquid Lithium into Lithium Gas."
		""
		"Goal: Craft a Rotary Condensentrator."
		""
		"Tips: Make sure the directional toggle is set correctly! It is the #1 reason this machine 'breaks' for new players."
		""
		"Trivia: 'Condensentrator' is a fun portmanteau unique to Mekanism."
	]
	quest.4CB3E1F490201460.quest_subtitle: "&3State Changes"
	quest.4CB3E1F490201460.title: "Rotary Condensentrator"
	quest.4CEB18214F19F462.quest_desc: ["Pulls things towards you. Like a magnet, but &dmagical and expensive&r."]
	quest.4CEB18214F19F462.quest_subtitle: "Gravity well"
	quest.4CEB18214F19F462.title: "&d&lRitual of Attraction&r"
	quest.4D01511948E6C002.quest_desc: [
		"&aCraft a &7Hardened Energy Cell&a for a significantly"
		"&alarger power buffer. Keep your network stable."
	]
	quest.4D01511948E6C002.quest_subtitle: "&7Larger buffer."
	quest.4D01511948E6C002.title: "&7&lEnergy Cell — Hardened"
	quest.4D07E633863CFF1C.quest_desc: [
		"&7Plant on farmland with matching infused soil to farm this resource hands-free.&r"
		""
		"&8Inferium to Insanium: the tier ladder that turns dirt into Allthemodium.&r"
	]
	quest.4D07E633863CFF1C.quest_subtitle: "Plant. Harvest. Repeat."
	quest.4D07E633863CFF1C.title: "Rabbit Seeds"
	quest.4D36797E0A2DB0F3.quest_desc: ["Explore the wonders of Silent Gear and master its mechanics."]
	quest.4D36797E0A2DB0F3.title: "Welcome to Silent Gear"
	quest.4D4D0D030FC297C4.title: "Advanced Mechanics"
	quest.4D5C461A815CBFD7.quest_desc: [
		"&e&l8x The Power!&r"
		""
		"&7Why build a massive room full of generators when you can compress them? This upgraded block generates exactly &a8 times&7 the power of its base tier, saving you precious space and cabling."
	]
	quest.4D5C461A815CBFD7.quest_subtitle: "8x power multiplier"
	quest.4D6F624752494E45.quest_desc: [
		"Welcome to &cMob Grinding Utils&r."
		""
		"Because hunting monsters in the dark is dangerous and, frankly, &ebeneath you&r. Why go to them when you can build a &6industrial meat grinder&r and have them delivered to your front door?"
	]
	quest.4D6F624752494E45.quest_subtitle: "The meat factory starts here"
	quest.4D6F624752494E45.title: "&c&lMeat Grinder Inc.&r"
	quest.4D6F624752494E48.quest_desc: [
		"The &8Mob Masher&r. It's essentially a giant blender for anything with a pulse (and some things without)."
		""
		"Place it at the end of a hallway and watch the &cloot&r roll in. Just don't stick your own arm in there."
	]
	quest.4D6F624752494E48.quest_subtitle: "Will it blend?"
	quest.4D6F624752494E48.title: "&4&lThe Blender&r"
	quest.4D6F624752494E4B.quest_desc: [
		"Your blender is a bit... &7basic&r."
		""
		"Slap some &eSharpness&r, &6Looting&r, or &cFire&r upgrades on it to make the monster's last moments even more efficient and profitable for you."
	]
	quest.4D6F624752494E4B.quest_subtitle: "Sharper, faster, luckier"
	quest.4D6F624752494E4B.title: "&e&lBlender Tuning&r"
	quest.4D6F624752494E52.quest_desc: [
		"Want a specific mob to spawn in your farm? Use a &fMob Swab&r to take some... &8DNA samples&r."
		""
		"Wipe the sweat off a zombie, craft it with a bucket of XP and seeds to make &2GM Chicken Feed&r."
	]
	quest.4D6F624752494E52.quest_subtitle: "Cursed genetic engineering"
	quest.4D6F624752494E52.title: "&6&lDNA Theft&r"
	quest.4D6F624752494E59.quest_desc: [
		"Feed the GM Chicken Feed to a chicken. It will violently explode, leaving behind a Spawn Egg or a Rotten Egg."
		""
		"Use the Rotten Egg on dirt to create &5Dreadful Dirt&r. It spawns hostile mobs at an absolutely terrifying rate. Keep it out of the sunlight!"
