	quest.4DF9A55BB881427B.title: "Advanced Mechanics"
	quest.4E05F0C42EE97D95.quest_desc: [
		"&6Runeworking&r is the pinnacle of spiritcraft. It is the act of inscribing meaning upon the bones of creation. Through a Runic Workbench, one may channel spirits into prepared materials, shaping Runes that hold will, memory, and command."
		""
		"Each rune grants power: some mirror the Spirit Rites of Totems, others imbue strength or speed, and a few hold secrets even the ancients feared to name."
		""
		"To wear a rune is to host a fragment of divinity. To craft one is to question where mortal craft ends and creation begins."
		""
		"Consult the &bEncyclopedia Arcana&r before attempting such work; even the old masters seldom survived their first flawless carving."
	]
	quest.4E05F0C42EE97D95.quest_subtitle: "Carve the truth into matter, and matter will answer."
	quest.4E05F0C42EE97D95.title: "&dRuneworking&r"
	quest.4E08364BF141690F.quest_desc: ["&7Latex extractor is the first machine in the mod. It does &cnot&7 require power to run, only to increase its efficiency of harvesting &flatex&7 from any &awood type&7. Best paired with somethin that places blocks."]
	quest.4E08364BF141690F.quest_subtitle: ",,only rubber trees give latex'' yeah? then check this out!"
	quest.4E08364BF141690F.title: "&bFluid Extractor"
	quest.4E0D5E134A2A4A35.quest_desc: ["Explore the wonders of Create Crafts Addition and master its mechanics."]
