	quest.51E0FCCD14BDF4A4.quest_desc: ["Spawner Runes are used to craft various Spawner-modifying items. Infused Spawner Runes are required for the more powerful modifications.\\n\\nWe'll need at least &a70 Eterna&r, &c30% Quanta&r, and &550% Arcana&r. \\n\\nTo get that, we can use either of the following:\\n\\n14 &9Deepshelves&r, that aren't &9Dormant&r!\\n12 &4Glowing Hellshelves&r and 2 &9Deepshelves&r!\\n12 &bCrystalline Seashelves&r and 2 &9Deepshelves&r!"]
