	quest.5BCC137666927134.quest_desc: ["&aEterna&r sets the &5Enchantment Level&r which determines what &5Enchantments&r you can or will get! \\n\\nIt's default is &a0&r and max is determined by your &lWorld Tier&r.\\n\\n&a30&r on &9&lHaven&r.\\n&a45&r on &2&lFrontier&r.\\n&a60&r on &e&lAscent&r.\\n&a75&r on &6&lSummit&r.\\n&a100&r on &4&lPinnacle&r.\\n\\nCheck out the Apotheosis Gear chapter or the linked quests in this chapter to learn more about &lWorld Tiers&r!\\n\\nAlmost all &7Bookshelves&r will give &aEterna&r but each has max they can set it to."]
	quest.5BCC137666927134.title: "&aEterna"
