		"Another step along this mod's arcane progression. The power curve here is steep, and skipping stages tends to cost more time than it saves."
		"Part of the &7Hostile Neural Networks&r progression."
		"&8Nothing further depends on this - build it when you want it, not because you have to."
	]
	quest.5F46031B1187857A.quest_subtitle: "&7Hostile Neural Networks"
	quest.5F46031B1187857A.title: "&6Prediction"
	quest.5F49BB9292134741.title: "First Steps"
	quest.5F4B5FA5F698D9B0.quest_desc: ["To get the &lWorld Tier: &2Frontier&r, you'll obviously need &9&lHaven&r done, but also need a few &eAffixed Items&r! \\n\\nHow many? You need a full set of &eAffixed Armor&r plus an &eAffixed Tool &for &eWeapon&r. \\n\\nNow &aUncommon&r &4Invaders &fand &aGems&r are most abundant, with the rest following in order: &8Common&r, &9Rare&r, and also &5Epic&r. \\n\\nThe Player with &lWorld Tier: &2Frontier&r will get a 35% Experience Boost, 20% Luck, and &a45 Max Eterna&r in total! \\n\\nHey, not everything will be easy though, now &4Monsters&r will gain 4 Armor Points extra."]
	quest.5F4B5FA5F698D9B0.title: "&lWorld Tier: &2Frontier"
	quest.5F6DAE97BB637487.quest_desc: ["Summons magical good boys to do your biting... I mean bidding."]
	quest.5F6DAE97BB637487.quest_subtitle: "Who's a good boy?"
	quest.5F6DAE97BB637487.title: "&7&lGlyph of Summon Wolves&r"
	quest.5F6EFEE790302393.quest_desc: ["whole  tank of water vapor"]
	quest.5F6EFEE790302393.quest_subtitle: "pharmaceudical"
	quest.5F6EFEE790302393.title: "&7Basic Chemical Tank"
	quest.5F7A4AE37B1C8D25.quest_desc: [
		"A blank piece of paper."
		""
		"You will need &cdouzens&r of these. Start a sugarcane farm now, or suffer later."
	]
	quest.5F7A4AE37B1C8D25.quest_subtitle: "Paperwork"
	quest.5F7A4AE37B1C8D25.title: "&f&lBlank Module&r"
	quest.5F90ACF86F3658B5.quest_desc: [
		"&6The high point of this chapter.&r"
		""
		"Craft or obtain the &6Player Transmitter Nitro&r."
		"It moves resources between machines. Throughput is the whole point - undersized transfer is the most common reason a factory looks busy but produces nothing."
		"Part of the &7Powah&r progression."
		"&8Take it or leave it - the chapter continues elsewhere."
	]
	quest.5F90ACF86F3658B5.quest_subtitle: "&7Powah"
	quest.5F90ACF86F3658B5.title: "&6Player Transmitter Nitro"
	quest.5F950149100F5FFA.quest_desc: [
		"A step up from what came before."
		""
		"Craft or obtain the &6Allthemodium Carrot&r."
		"Raw material for the tiers above. The sooner production is automated, the sooner the recipes that consume it stop being a bottleneck."
		"Part of the &7AllTheModium&r progression."
		"&8A side branch. Optional, but rarely a waste of time."
	]
	quest.5F950149100F5FFA.quest_subtitle: "&7AllTheModium"
	quest.5F950149100F5FFA.title: "&6Allthemodium Carrot"
	quest.5F9EA56031A35021.quest_desc: [
		"&7A valuable gem — socket it, craft with it, or hoard it.&r"
		""
		"&8Farm your resources. &dMystical Agriculture&7 grows what miners dig.&r"
	]
	quest.5F9EA56031A35021.quest_subtitle: "Worth the dig"
	quest.5F9EA56031A35021.title: "Inferium Gemstone"
	quest.5FA0D2EAA359B39A.quest_desc: [
		"Place the &bEnchanting Apparatus&r on top of the Arcane Core."
		"Surround it with Arcane Pedestals to craft magical gear, charms, and powerful items!"
	]
	quest.5FA0D2EAA359B39A.quest_subtitle: "The magic blender"
	quest.5FA0D2EAA359B39A.title: "&d&lEnchanting Apparatus&r"
	quest.5FC889B96BD5E7F4.quest_desc: [
		"&7Plant on farmland with matching infused soil to farm this resource hands-free.&r"
		""
		"&8Inferium to Insanium: the tier ladder that turns dirt into Allthemodium.&r"
	]
	quest.5FC889B96BD5E7F4.quest_subtitle: "Plant. Harvest. Repeat."
	quest.5FC889B96BD5E7F4.title: "Ice Seeds"
	quest.5FCA70905B6463F8.quest_desc: ["Undo your mistakes. If only this worked in &creal life&r."]
	quest.5FCA70905B6463F8.quest_subtitle: "It's rewind time"
	quest.5FCA70905B6463F8.title: "&6&lGlyph of Rewind&r"
	quest.5FE55D933BB17503.quest_desc: ["More integration armor that makes you literally unkillable. The balance of this modpack is officially &clong gone&r."]
	quest.5FE55D933BB17503.quest_subtitle: "God pajamas"
	quest.5FE55D933BB17503.title: "&e&lAllthemodium Mage Chestplate&r"
	quest.5FEC6CB93CDFDCDC.quest_desc: [
		"The chapter widens out from here."
		""
		"Craft or obtain the &5Datura&r."
		"Slow, ritualistic magic. The pacing is deliberate and the payoffs are worth waiting for."
		"Part of the &7Occultism&r progression."
		"&8Next: Divination Rod, Iesnium Ore."
	]
	quest.5FEC6CB93CDFDCDC.quest_subtitle: "&7Occultism"
	quest.5FEC6CB93CDFDCDC.title: "&5Datura"
	quest.600A836752FFFE6F.quest_desc: ["Arcane Pedestals are used for Rituals and the Enchanting Apparatus. You'll need quite a few of these!"]
	quest.600A836752FFFE6F.quest_subtitle: "Ritualistic interior design"
	quest.600A836752FFFE6F.title: "&8&lArcane Pedestal&r"
	quest.600B2CBC88A566BE.quest_desc: [
		"All &5Enchantments&r from the &5Enchantment Table&r is determined by the Levels of &aEterna&r, &cQuanta&r, and &5Arcana&r. \\n\\nWe can see the Pool of &5Enchantments&r available by clicking the ? in the Top Right of the &5Enchantment Table's&r GUI when an Item is being &5Enchanted&r. \\n\\nThe higher the &cQuanta&r is, the better the chance we get a weaker &5Enchantment&r gets. \\n\\nWith the &6Geode-Encased Bookshelf of Stability&r it will get rid of the increased chances of worse &5Enchantments&r."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"To Craft it we'll need a &7Bookshelf&r, 7 Calcite, and 1 &5Budding Amethyst&r. \\n\\n&5Budding Amethyst&r can not be collected from Mining, even with &5Silk Touch&r. You'll need either a Ritual or Infusion to get one then!"
	]
	quest.600B2CBC88A566BE.title: "&6Negative Enchantments Removal"
	quest.602F84F28367C3E8.quest_desc: ["&bLogistics Drones&r sort items automatically via Logistics Frames."]
	quest.602F84F28367C3E8.quest_subtitle: "&7PneumaticCraft"
	quest.602F84F28367C3E8.title: "&6Logistics Drone"
	quest.603484824DB6433A.quest_desc: ["&7Spinning 3 isotopes at once. Dizzy yet?"]
	quest.603484824DB6433A.quest_subtitle: "&aSpin cycle"
	quest.603484824DB6433A.title: "&aBasic Centrifuging Factory"
	quest.6038487964E48F50.quest_desc: [
		"The &8Bronze Macerator&r uses steam pressure to crush ores into dusts much faster than your hand hammer."
		""
		"This effectively &adoubles&r your ore output! Crush one ore to get two dusts, then smelt them."
	]
	quest.6038487964E48F50.quest_subtitle: "Crushing efficiency"
	quest.6038487964E48F50.title: "&8Ore Doubling"
	quest.603ECA4F445A6047.quest_desc: ["&79 slots. Cleans ores so well they practically cease to exist."]
	quest.603ECA4F445A6047.quest_subtitle: "&dSqueaky clean"
	quest.603ECA4F445A6047.title: "&dUltimate Washing Factory"
	quest.608CDB9A40A50FAC.quest_desc: ["Share health. Great if your friend is a tank, terrible if they keep &cjumping in lava&r."]
	quest.608CDB9A40A50FAC.quest_subtitle: "Symbiosis"
	quest.608CDB9A40A50FAC.title: "&4&lGlyph of Life Link&r"
	quest.60A5F526A6DB2CE0.quest_desc: [
		"This is where the chapter stops being introductory."
		""
		"Craft or obtain the &bPellet Plutonium&r."
		"Mekanism scales in clean, predictable tiers. Build the infrastructure once and every later upgrade slots straight into it."
		"Part of the &7Mekanism&r progression."
		"&8Next: Sps Casing."
	]
	quest.60A5F526A6DB2CE0.quest_subtitle: "&7Mekanism"
	quest.60A5F526A6DB2CE0.title: "&bPellet Plutonium"
	quest.60B5266C8BACE455.quest_desc: [
		"&fA solid step up.&r"
		""
		"&7More efficient and faster than its copper cousin. This sturdy generator will form the backbone of your early-game power grid."
	]
	quest.60B5266C8BACE455.quest_subtitle: "A solid upgrade"
	quest.60B5266C8BACE455.title: "&f&lIron Generator&r"
	quest.60C32BE44B506864.quest_desc: [
		"You have the prerequisites. Now put them to use."
		""
		"Craft or obtain the &bBattery Hardened&r."
		"It buffers energy so that machines drawing in bursts do not stall the rest of your network."
		"Part of the &7Powah&r progression."
		"&8Next: Battery Blazing."
	]
	quest.60C32BE44B506864.quest_subtitle: "&7Powah"
	quest.60C32BE44B506864.title: "&bBattery Hardened"
	quest.60C432DC03471A97.quest_desc: [
		"&7Head protection with a little something extra.&r"
		""
		"&8Plant essence seeds, harvest the world — ore farming without the mineshaft.&r"
	]
	quest.60C432DC03471A97.quest_subtitle: "Cover your head"
	quest.60C432DC03471A97.title: "Prudentium Helmet"
	quest.60C957B013EABF8D.quest_desc: [
		"The &dSpirit Crucible&r is the forge of the unseen, a conduit where thought and essence are pressed into matter. Centered upon an Alchemical Impetus, it channels Spirits into solid form, crafting dusts, gems, and relics that reflect their nature."
		""
		"The Impetus itself, though powerful, is mortal in its endurance. Overuse will consume it, though a careful hand may mend its form or fashion a new one entirely."
		""
		"In time, you may craft other kinds of Impetus, each unlocking further mysteries of transmutation. Treat the Crucible not as a tool, but as a heart; for when it stills, the world forgets to change."
	]
	quest.60C957B013EABF8D.quest_subtitle: "The vessel remembers every flame that fed it."
	quest.60C957B013EABF8D.title: "&dSpirit Crucible&r"
	quest.60CAE268D81AE820.quest_desc: [
		"&7Infuse Blaze Powder in the Orb."
		""
		"&aThe &cBlazing Crystal&a unlocks the &lBlazing&r&a tier."
		"&aYour machines are now starting to become"
		"&aseriously fast and powerful."
	]
	quest.60CAE268D81AE820.quest_subtitle: "&7Heating things up."
	quest.60CAE268D81AE820.title: "&c&lBlazing Power (Blazing)"
	quest.60D546CC520F9552.quest_desc: [
		"&7No machine will work without power."
		""
		"&7This simple generator burns coal or wood to produce your first units of energy (RF/FE)."
	]
	quest.60D546CC520F9552.title: "&cBasic Generator"
	quest.60E3903A11E4CAE3.quest_desc: ["&6Blazing Magmator&r. Fire generating power from fire. It makes sense, but the crafting cost is &egetting out of hand&r."]
	quest.60E3903A11E4CAE3.title: "&6&lBlazing Magmator&r"
	quest.60E886A80D0DD4A0.quest_desc: ["&b32 wind generators&r in one block. The density of this object is &calarming&r."]
	quest.60E886A80D0DD4A0.quest_subtitle: "32x spin"
	quest.60E886A80D0DD4A0.title: "&b&lCompressed Wind x32&r"
	quest.6100F85E22FC5385.quest_desc: [
		"&7Passive power is fine, but steam is better."
		""
		"&aReplace your Power Tap with two &bFluid Access Ports&a."
		"&aPump Water into the input port. The reactor will"
		"&aboil the water and output massive amounts of &fSteam&a."
	]
	quest.6100F85E22FC5385.quest_subtitle: "&7Turning heat into steam."
	quest.6100F85E22FC5385.title: "&b&lActive Cooling"
	quest.610E1A9B21FF89D1.quest_desc: [
		"&c&lAbsolute Compression!&r"
		""
		"&7The ultimate space-saver. This absolute unit of a generator packs the punch of &a64 base-tier generators&7 into a single block. Ensure your cables can handle the massive &eFE/t&7 transfer rate!"
	]
	quest.610E1A9B21FF89D1.quest_subtitle: "64x power multiplier"
	quest.611A0A88310ABDBD.quest_desc: [
		"A natural continuation of the previous step."
		""
		"Craft or obtain the &bCrystal Nitro&r."
		"A crafting intermediate. Boring on its own, essential in volume - automate production before the recipes that need it pile up."
		"Part of the &7Powah&r progression."
		"&8Nothing further depends on this - build it when you want it, not because you have to."
	]
	quest.611A0A88310ABDBD.quest_subtitle: "&7Powah"
	quest.611A0A88310ABDBD.title: "&bCrystal Nitro"
	quest.6124D5E0E2D2712D.quest_desc: ["Magical looting. Gimme more &bdiamonds&r."]
	quest.6124D5E0E2D2712D.quest_subtitle: "Casino magic"
	quest.6124D5E0E2D2712D.title: "&e&lGlyph of Fortune&r"
	quest.612798B8F4F6E013.quest_subtitle: "Ogromna moc x64!"
	quest.61438033BAA955DC.quest_desc: ["Crushes items into subatomic particles."]
	quest.61438033BAA955DC.quest_subtitle: "Subatomic smash"
	quest.61438033BAA955DC.title: "&b&lCosmic Crushing Factory&r"
	quest.61449B227D7E9D3F.quest_desc: [
		"The chapter widens out from here."
		""
		"Craft or obtain the &7Basic Chemical Tank&r."
		"Bulk fluid storage. Buffering fluids is what stops a processing line from stuttering every time upstream production dips."
		"Part of the &7Mekanism&r progression."
		"&8Next: Fusion Reactor Controller, Chemical Infuser."
	]
	quest.61449B227D7E9D3F.quest_subtitle: "(3)tium"
	quest.61449B227D7E9D3F.title: "&7Basic Chemical Tank"
	quest.61872C2FF0E6A44D.quest_desc: [
		"&aUpgrade to &eHardened Solar Panels&a."
		"&7A meaningful jump in daytime FE/t output."
		"&7Combine with Energy Cells to store surplus power."
	]
	quest.61872C2FF0E6A44D.quest_subtitle: "&7Greater solar efficiency."
	quest.61872C2FF0E6A44D.title: "&e&lSolar Panel — Hardened"
	quest.618914E7887539B9.quest_desc: [
		"&7Welcome to the ultimate item storage solution."
		""
		"&eDrawers allow you to store massive amounts of a single item in one block."
		"&aCraft your first Basic Drawer to begin organizing your chaos."
	]
	quest.618914E7887539B9.quest_subtitle: "&7The first step"
	quest.618914E7887539B9.title: "&4&lFunctional Storage"
	quest.618F976C91F18289.quest_desc: [
		"The next link in the chain."
		""
		"Craft or obtain the &bId Card&r."
		"Another piece of the machine chain. On its own it does little; wired into the rest of your factory it removes one more job you were doing by hand."
		"Part of the &7Modular Force Field System&r progression."
		"&8The end of this branch."
	]
	quest.618F976C91F18289.quest_subtitle: "&7Modular Force Field System"
	quest.618F976C91F18289.title: "&bId Card"
	quest.619246BB58798B2A.quest_desc: [
		"&6A milestone.&r"
		""
		"Craft or obtain the &6Confiscation Module&r."
		"An upgrade module. Slotting these in is how you turn a functional machine into a fast one without rebuilding your entire setup."
		"Part of the &7Modular Force Field System&r progression."
		"&8The end of this branch."
	]
	quest.619246BB58798B2A.quest_subtitle: "&7Modular Force Field System"
	quest.619246BB58798B2A.title: "&6Confiscation Module"
	quest.61A1D29AC4CBF3DB.quest_desc: [
		"&6A milestone.&r"
		""
		"Craft or obtain the &6Infinity Wand&r."
		"A tool or weapon at this tier. Better reach, better speed, and usually a special ability worth learning."
		"Part of the &7Construction Wand&r progression."
		"&8Take it or leave it - the chapter continues elsewhere."
	]
	quest.61A1D29AC4CBF3DB.quest_subtitle: "&6The top of this ladder"
	quest.61A1D29AC4CBF3DB.title: "&6Infinity Wand"
	quest.61A88381722354C2.quest_desc: [
		"&7Your first step into modern technology is finding &dFluxite&7."
		""
		"&7This unique crystal can be found underground. It is the foundation of all machines and energy transfer systems in Oritech."
	]
	quest.61A88381722354C2.title: "&dOritech Era"
	quest.61AFA9943590B0C7.quest_subtitle: "Wirelessly charge inventory"
	quest.61B67ED52DC8D3B4.quest_desc: [
		"Progress here compounds - each tier makes the next one cheaper."
		""
		"Craft or obtain the &aSkillet&r."
		"Raw material for the tiers above. The sooner production is automated, the sooner the recipes that consume it stop being a bottleneck."
		"Part of the &7Farmer's Delight&r progression."
		"&8Next: Pufferfish."
	]
	quest.61B67ED52DC8D3B4.quest_subtitle: "&7Farmer's Delight"
	quest.61B67ED52DC8D3B4.title: "&aSkillet"
	quest.61C92FEAE3E6AC1D.quest_desc: ["&aBasic Thermo&r. Marginally better. Put down like 10 of these and you can pretend you have a &ereal power grid&r."]
	quest.61C92FEAE3E6AC1D.title: "&f&lBasic Thermo&r"
	quest.61CF14ABAB302D58.quest_desc: ["The &5Enchantment Library&r is the single greatest &5Enchanted Book&r storage, ever! \\n\\nTo Craft it you'll need 4 &3Ender Chests&r, 1 &5Enchanting Table&r, and 4 of any of the &d&lInfused&r &7Bookshelves&r: &4Infused Hellshelf&r, &bInfused Seashelves&r, and &9Deepshelves&r. \\n\\nTo use it, you can either Shift Left Click &5Enchanted Books&r or bring them into the &9Blue Slot&r. This will add the &5Books&r to the &5Library&r. \\n\\nThe &5Books&r are sorted by name and are held in Points. Each Level of &5Enchanted Book&r determines the Level, and it is reflected on how many &5Books&r would be needed to get that Level. Level 1, is 1 Point. Level 2 is 2 Points. Level 3 is 4 Points. Level 4 is 8 Points. \\n\\nEach &5Book&r is stored to a max of 32768 Points, and they can be extracted by Left Clicking the stored &5Book&r. Each Click will add another Level to the &5Book&r in the &6Orange Slot&r. \\n\\nYou can Click different &5Books&r to add to the &5Book&r in the &6Orange Slot&r, similar to combining &5Books&r in an Anvil. \\n\\nThe max Level of &5Enchanted Book&r is determined by the highest Level of &5Book&r you've put in. It doesn't matter if you have 32000 Points, if you only put in &5Sharpness III&r, you can only take out &5Sharpness III&r."]
	quest.61CF14ABAB302D58.title: "&5Enchantment Library"
	quest.621050FB6EB983BD.quest_desc: [
		"Travel time is the hidden cost of every project."
		"Waystones, portals and later the Mekanism Teleporter all cut it down. Build them early; the time saved compounds over the whole playthrough."
		"&8Next: a few settings worth changing before you start."
	]
	quest.621050FB6EB983BD.quest_subtitle: "&7Progress, compounded"
	quest.621050FB6EB983BD.title: "&6Waypoints and Travel"
	quest.62505EE89F1D903E.quest_desc: ["&7Starter Furnator&r. Burns coal. Makes power. The absolute &ebottom of the barrel&r of tech mod power generation."]
	quest.62505EE89F1D903E.quest_subtitle: "carbonized"
	quest.62505EE89F1D903E.title: "&7&lStarter Furnator&r"
	quest.625A9494D8C07F88.quest_desc: [
