		"Lore: Catches atmospheric drafts, spinning a turbine to generate continuous power."
		""
		"Technical Information: Must have clear sky access. Output increases the higher the Y-level it is placed at."
		""
		"Usage: Place at max build height for an incredible amount of passive early/mid-game power."
		""
		"Goal: Craft a Wind Generator."
		""
		"Tips: Run cables down a column from the build limit to your base for totally free, maintenance-free energy."
		""
		"Trivia: The spinning blade animation actually accelerates based on the generation rate!"
	]
