	quest.6A8A44103182C3F7.quest_desc: [
		"Lore: Specialized internal linings allow these pipes to transfer immense amounts of liquids flawlessly."
		""
		"Technical Information: Upgrading tiers vastly increases flow rate (mB/t)."
		""
		"Usage: Transfers water, lava, and chemicals. Shift-right click with a Configurator to set to 'Pull' mode."
		""
		"Goal: Craft all tiers of Mechanical Pipes."
		""
		"Tips: A single Ultimate Mechanical Pipe can transfer enough water to cool a massive fission reactor."
		""
		"Trivia: The glass center allows you to visually track the fluids moving through the network."
	]
