		"You will literally spend more time building this gigantic, &cSulfuric-Acid-spewing&r factory than you would have spent just going down into the cave to &emine more ore&r."
	]
	quest.6CA61D24D6139697.quest_subtitle: "Quintuple the trouble"
	quest.6CA61D24D6139697.title: "&4&lOre Quintupling (x5)&r"
	quest.6CB0927AEF02FCA7.quest_desc: ["merges up to 5 laser beams together or stores their collective energy to release it later"]
