	quest.6CB48254BB1B4C55.title: "First Steps"
	quest.6CB5ACBAAED66871.quest_desc: [
		"Everything that follows in this chapter starts here."
		""
		"Earn the &6Find Mushroom House&r advancement. It marks a genuine change in what you are able to do, not just another item in a chest."
		"&8Nothing further depends on this - build it when you want it, not because you have to."
	]
	quest.6CB5ACBAAED66871.quest_subtitle: "&7Where this chapter begins"
	quest.6CB5ACBAAED66871.title: "&6Find Mushroom House"
	quest.6CCC6B1209FCAFDE.quest_desc: [
		"&7Harness the power of the sun!"
		""
		"&aPlace a &eSolar Panel&a in direct sunlight."
		"&7It generates power during the day"
		"&7and nothing at night."
		""
		"&7Build many of them — each one adds up."
		"&7Higher tiers generate exponentially more FE/t."
	]
	quest.6CCC6B1209FCAFDE.quest_subtitle: "&7Free power from sunlight."
	quest.6CCC6B1209FCAFDE.title: "&e&lSolar Panel — Basic"
	quest.6CDB41035F1BCBA4.quest_desc: [
		"In the early days, the soulwrights discovered that Spirit, in its raw form, defied all weight and measure. It drifted unseen, unheld... a song without a vessel. To harness such essence, they forged the &dSpirit Jar&r, a vessel of Hallowed Gold tempered in sacred flame."
		""
		"Within these jars, spirits find stillness. Though their capacity nears infinity, each jar may cradle only a single aspect. Arcane, Wicked, or otherwise. The containment is not force, but pact; the gold itself whispers lullabies that the restless obey."
		""
		"Hold one near a freshly fallen soul and listen closely. If you are worthy, the jar will sing back."
	]
	quest.6CDB41035F1BCBA4.quest_subtitle: "Contain the formless, and you will learn the true weight of nothing."
	quest.6CDB41035F1BCBA4.title: "&dSpirit Jar&r"
	quest.6D05A91CF8CA9AC6.quest_desc: [
		"&7Your first step into modern technology is finding &dFluxite&7."
		""
		"&7This unique crystal can be found underground. It is the foundation of all machines and energy transfer systems in Oritech."
	]
	quest.6D05A91CF8CA9AC6.title: "&dOritech Era"
	quest.6D079860D9AE6499.quest_desc: [
		"Transfers an absurd amount of gas."
		""
		"Perfect for your unnecessarily large, highly radioactive fission reactor."
	]
	quest.6D079860D9AE6499.quest_subtitle: "Dangerous fumes"
	quest.6D079860D9AE6499.title: "&e&lAbsolute Pressurized Tube&r"
