	quest.72BEAE13F2DB01DA.quest_desc: ["The &8Tome of Miners&r will help you with all your Mining. It will give &5Efficiency&f, &5Fortune&f, and &5Silk Touch&r. \\n\\nThese work for Pickaxes, Axes, Shovels, and even Hoes! \\n\\n&8Tome of the Fishers&r will only give Fishing Rod &5Enchantments&r, and yeah there is a lot."]
