	quest.72EC815A650AE398.quest_desc: ["For &l&2Frontier&r the Rarity of &eAffixes&r didn't matter, but now for &l&eAscent&r you'll need everything being &aUncommon&r or better. \\n\\nYou'll also need to kill an &4Invader&r aka an &6&lApothic&r Boss, to upgrade your &lWorld Tier&r. The Rarity of &4Boss&r doesn't matter! \\n\\n&eAffixes&r will only stay up to &5Epic&r but now &9Rare&r is more common than the rest. We can also get &6Mythic&r &aGems&r... just only with Lady Luck's Favor! \\n\\nSpeaking of Luck, our Luck will increase to 30%, Experience will jump to 55%, and &aMax Eterna&r will rise to &a60&r. \\n\\n&4Monsters&r in return will now have 8 Armor Points and 5 Armor Pierce."]
	quest.72EC815A650AE398.title: "&lWorld Tier: &eAscent"
	quest.72FB30C6DF7AF901.quest_desc: [
		"&7A dark presence takes root in the world..."
		""
		"&eThe demonic Qliphoth tree has awakened."
		"&aPrepare yourself for a battle against the ultimate evil."
	]
	quest.72FB30C6DF7AF901.quest_subtitle: "&7One step further"
	quest.72FB30C6DF7AF901.title: "&4&lQliphoth Awakening"
	quest.72FD8EF56B4C33AE.quest_desc: [
		"Lore: Your first true machine. It alters the molecular structure of metals by infusing them with secondary substances."
		""
		"Technical Information: Requires FE (Forge Energy) to run. Features a separate internal buffer for the infused material (e.g., Redstone)."
		""
		"Usage: Insert Redstone, Coal, Diamond, or Obsidian dust into the secondary slot, and an ingot into the primary slot."
		""
		"Goal: Craft a Metallurgic Infuser."
		""
		"Tips: Build multiple infusers. Dedicating one to Redstone and another to Carbon prevents wasted materials in the buffer."
		""
		"Trivia: The Metallurgic Infuser is the single most crafted machine in Mekanism due to component requirements."
	]
	quest.72FD8EF56B4C33AE.quest_subtitle: "&cMetallurgic Infusion"
	quest.72FD8EF56B4C33AE.title: "Metallurgic Infuser"
