	quest.7B3264A84214A654.title: "&aSection Complete"
	quest.7B393BA4F357288C.quest_desc: [
		"The &dEncyclopedia Arcana&r is no mere tome of recipes and rituals. It is a vessel of remembrance; the accumulated thoughts of soulwrights long turned to dust. Its pages shift with unseen ink, revealing what is known and hiding what is not yet earned."
		""
		"Through its study, one may learn the patterns of Spirit Infusion, the rites of Runewood Totems, and the secrets of Soulbinding and Runeworking. Each discovery feeds back into the tome, awakening new passages that were once sealed by ignorance."
		""
		"Treat it not as a guide, but as a companion. It listens as much as it instructs, and at times, it may whisper truths you did not seek."
		""
		"To consult the Encyclopedia Arcana is to walk beside every hand that ever shaped Malum... and to risk adding your own name to its margins."
	]
	quest.7B393BA4F357288C.quest_subtitle: "The book does not teach, it remembers."
	quest.7B393BA4F357288C.title: "&dEncyclopedia Arcana&r"
	quest.7B406B81138B64DF.quest_desc: [
		"Upon the &dWeaver’s Workbench&r, the mage becomes tailor and artist both. Here, magical spools intertwine with armor, altering appearance without diminishing its strength or essence."
		""
		"Each Weave imparts a new visage, a reflection of its creator’s will. The Ancient Weave transcends mere illusion, converting armor into an alternate self entirely, while lesser weaves merely shift form."
		""
		"Thus, a &bSoulhunter Robe&r may take the shape of a &bSoulstained Chestplate&r, both united under a single pattern. The wise see the lesson: power’s shape is fleeting, but its spirit remains."
	]
	quest.7B406B81138B64DF.quest_subtitle: "Threads of power, once entwined, do not forgive clumsy hands."
	quest.7B406B81138B64DF.title: "&dWeaver’s Workbench&r"
	quest.7B41DEEA15D2B08A.quest_desc: [
		"&7Plant on farmland with matching infused soil to farm this resource hands-free.&r"
		""
		"&8Plant essence seeds, harvest the world — ore farming without the mineshaft.&r"
	]
	quest.7B41DEEA15D2B08A.quest_subtitle: "Plant. Harvest. Repeat."
	quest.7B41DEEA15D2B08A.title: "Blaze Seeds"
	quest.7B58054D77501C34.quest_desc: ["&7There are &e4 ways&7 in which water can be supplied to a LPU, : &b1 - kitchen sink&7 ( cooking for blockheads ), &b2 - fluid collector&7 (IF), &b3 - fluid pump&7 (meka) &b4 - pump&7 (create). all these methods require pipes."]
	quest.7B58054D77501C34.quest_subtitle: "These three other elements apparently made a banger song without me, which i do not remember."
