	quest.7D6B86722B2D7B91.title: "Coal Seeds"
	quest.7D7DE53A1C6A1573.quest_desc: ["Half the &firon&r in your base just turned into these sticks. For some reason, the mod forces you to craft a &avertical&r and a &ehorizontal&r version. &3 luckily, with a reversible crafting (vertical to horizontal and reverse)"]
	quest.7D7DE53A1C6A1573.quest_subtitle: "Rods of jod"
	quest.7D7DE53A1C6A1573.title: "&7&lDielectric Rods&r"
	quest.7D92151B18D44C73.title: "Advanced Mechanics"
	quest.7DAFD84CE5CE1E46.quest_desc: [
		"Lore: Passes extreme voltage through resistive coils to generate pure, concentrated heat."
		""
		"Technical Information: Consumes FE to produce Heat. You can set the exact FE/t consumption in its UI."
		""
		"Usage: Essential for maxing out the temperature of a Thermal Evaporation Plant."
		""
		"Goal: Craft a Resistive Heater."
		""
		"Tips: Be careful! You can easily drain your entire power network by setting the usage limit too high."
		""
		"Trivia: Modeled after real-world industrial resistive heating elements."
	]
	quest.7DAFD84CE5CE1E46.quest_subtitle: "&cElectric Heat"
	quest.7DAFD84CE5CE1E46.title: "Resistive Heater"
	quest.7DEEFEE99D4F1153.quest_desc: ["Filled with curses and fangs. Probably smells like &crotten flesh&r."]
	quest.7DEEFEE99D4F1153.quest_subtitle: "Spooky stories"
	quest.7DEEFEE99D4F1153.title: "&8&lEvoker Spell Book&r"
	quest.7DF9870C61B1EC89.quest_desc: ["&7Use the Fragment Forge to create Electrum (Gold + Silver) and Invar (Iron + Nickel)."]
	quest.7DF9870C61B1EC89.title: "&eAdvanced Alloys"
	quest.7E0178CE1082F2D0.quest_desc: [
		"Offer five Arcane Spirits to a totem pole and speak the invocation of release... the Unchained Rite."
		""
		"What follows cannot be undone. A surge of raw, archaic potential floods the land, twisting all that is natural into blighted reflection. Grass blackens, soil turns to Blighted Earth, and even the totem itself is reborn as Soulwood, forever changed."
		""
		"This corruption stabilizes over time, becoming a controlled current through which new materials may be transmuted. Yet, be wary of the Soulwood Saplings it breeds. When grown, they echo the blight that birthed them, spreading their corruption anew."
		""
		"Cultivate with care. What you unchain may not wish to be bound again."
	]
	quest.7E0178CE1082F2D0.quest_subtitle: "To call upon chaos is to teach the forest to scream."
	quest.7E0178CE1082F2D0.title: "&dUnchained Rite&r"
	quest.7E20D87B727C060E.quest_desc: ["&7Plastic's almost here, just need to &csmelt it.&7"]
	quest.7E20D87B727C060E.quest_subtitle: "...were distastrous to human race"
	quest.7E20D87B727C060E.title: "&bDryrubber"
	quest.7E3F362C5CF1391E.quest_desc: ["This one is not required for the main shelf progression, but is necessary for certain &d&lInfusions&r.\\n\\nThe penultimate &lWorld Tier&r, &6&lSummit&r raises your &aMax Eterna&r to &a75&r."]
	quest.7E3F362C5CF1391E.quest_subtitle: "Max Eterna to 75"
	quest.7E3F362C5CF1391E.title: "To reach the &6&lSummit"
	quest.7E6890426F32B7C1.quest_desc: [
		"&7The engineering marvel is complete."
		""
		"&aPlace the &eTurbine Controller&a. Ensure your"
		"&arotor speed stays in the optimal RPM range"
		"&afor maximum efficiency."
		""
		"&aYou have mastered nuclear physics!"
	]
	quest.7E6890426F32B7C1.quest_subtitle: "&e&lThe ultimate power source."
	quest.7E6890426F32B7C1.title: "&e&lMaximum Overdrive"
	quest.7E68E606E0A554F3.quest_desc: [
		"In the ages that followed the first Altars, even the most devoted soulwrights grew weary of the slow rhythm of Spirit Infusion. To craft a mere stack of Hex Ash could consume entire moons. Thus was born the &dRunewood Obelisk&r, a monument of Hallowed Gold and living wood, tuned to hasten the flow of the unseen."
		""
		"When placed within the Altar’s reach, each Obelisk draws in latent ether and bends it toward the focus, quickening the process by one fourth. Four may stand in harmony, their combined hum weaving time itself tighter around the ritual flame."
		""
		"Be wary, however, the spirits are not fond of haste. Listen too closely, and you may hear them protest in the crackle of the air."
	]
	quest.7E68E606E0A554F3.quest_subtitle: "Patience is a virtue—yet even the patient may crave swifter revelation."
	quest.7E7450BBBC5FD908.quest_desc: ["The &6Assembly Line&r automates complex crafts using pneumatic arms and lasers."]
	quest.7E7450BBBC5FD908.quest_subtitle: "&7PneumaticCraft"
	quest.7E7450BBBC5FD908.title: "&bAssembly Controller"
	quest.7E7E2DD65E554CEB.quest_desc: ["Increases energy transfer limits to 'absurd'."]
	quest.7E7E2DD65E554CEB.quest_subtitle: "Fast charging"
	quest.7E7E2DD65E554CEB.title: "&e&lAbsolute Provider&r"
	quest.7E83F981C4CE214E.quest_desc: [
		"The ultimate tier of Autocrafter."
		""
		"Crafts items at blazing fast speeds, significantly speeding up large auto-crafting requests."
	]
	quest.7E83F981C4CE214E.quest_subtitle: "&7Extra Storage"
	quest.7E83F981C4CE214E.title: "&8&lNetherite Crafter&r"
	quest.7E885617BB96F41E.quest_desc: [
		"&7A useful component on the road through &dMystical Agradditions&7. Add it to the collection and keep moving.&r"
		""
		"&8When Supremium is no longer enough, this is where the ladder continues.&r"
	]
	quest.7E885617BB96F41E.quest_subtitle: "Stock the shelves"
	quest.7E885617BB96F41E.title: "Insanium Coal"
