		"Lore: A micro-processed lattice woven with diamond thread. It can process quantum logic commands."
		""
		"Technical Information: Requires Enriched Diamond and an Advanced Control Circuit in an Infuser."
		""
		"Usage: Used to ascend to the Elite tier of machinery and high-end power storage."
		""
		"Goal: Craft 6 Elite Control Circuits."
		""
		"Tips: Enriched Diamond is extremely potent. One diamond yields enough infusion material for multiple circuits."
		""
		"Trivia: The bright blue diamond texture signifies the transition into high-cost, high-reward technology."
	]
	quest.7F91A025A78841B2.quest_subtitle: "&bElite Circuits"
	quest.7F91A025A78841B2.title: "Elite Control Circuits"
